{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-11-1","title":"Jeremiah 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Jeremiah proclaims God's covenant; 8 rebukes the Jews' disobeying thereof; 11 prophesies evils to come upon them; 18 and upon the men of Anathoth, for conspiring to kill him.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-2","title":"Jeremiah 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>A.M. 3406. B.C. 598. 6; 34:13-16; Ex 19:5; 2Ki 11:17; 23:2,3; 2Ch 23:16; 29:10 2Ch 34:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-3","title":"Jeremiah 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>De 27:26; 28:15-68; 29:19,20; Ga 3:10-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-4","title":"Jeremiah 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I commanded. 31:32; Ex 24:3-8; De 5:2,3; 29:10-15; Eze 20:6-12; Heb 8:8-10 iron. De 4:20; 1Ki 8:51; Isa 48:10 Obey. 7:22,23; 26:13; Ex 20:6; 23:21,22; Le 26:3,12; De 11:27; 28:1-14 1Sa 15:22; Zec 6:15; Mt 28:20; Heb 5:9 ye be. 24:7; 30:22; 31:31,33; 32:28; Ge 17:8; Le 26:12; Eze 11:20; 14:11 Eze 36:28; 37:23,27; Zec 8:8; 13:9; 2Co 6:16; Heb 8:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-5","title":"Jeremiah 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>perform. Ge 22:16-18; 26:3-5; Ps 105:9-11 a land. Ex 3:8-17; Le 20:24; De 6:3; 7:12,13 So be it. Heb. Amen. 28:6; De 27:15-26; Mt 6:13; 1Co 14:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-6","title":"Jeremiah 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Proclaim. 3:12; 7:2; 19:2; Isa 58:1; Zec 7:7 Hear. 2-4; Ps 15:5; Joh 13:17; Ro 2:13; Jas 1:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-7","title":"Jeremiah 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>I earnestly. 1Sa 8:9; Eph 4:17; 2Th 3:12 in the. 7:13,23-25; 25:4; 35:15; Ex 15:26; 23:21,22; De 4:6; 5:29; 6:2; 8:6 De 10:12,13; 11:26-28; 12:32; 28:1-14; 30:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-8","title":"Jeremiah 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>obeyed. 3:17; 6:16,17; 7:24,26; 9:13,14; 35:15; 44:17; Ne 9:16,17,26,29 Eze 20:8,18-21; Zec 7:11 imagination. or, stubbornness. 7:24; *marg: therefore. Le 26:16-46; De 28:15-68; 29:21-24; 30:17-19; 31:17,18; 32:20-26 Jos 23:13-16; Eze 20:37,38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-9","title":"Jeremiah 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>5:31; 6:13; 8:10; Eze 22:25-31; Ho 6:9; Mic 3:11; 7:2,3; Zep 3:1-4 Mt 21:38,39; 26:3,4,15; Joh 11:53; Ac 23:12-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-10","title":"Jeremiah 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>turned. 3:10; 1Sa 15:11; 2Ch 34:30-33; Ho 6:4; 7:16; Zep 1:6 iniquities. Jud 2:17,19; Ps 78:8-10,57; Eze 20:18-21; Zec 1:4; Ac 7:51,52 the house of Israel. 3:6-11; 31:32; Le 26:15; De 31:16; 2Ki 17:7-20; Eze 16:59; 44:7 Ho 6:7; 8:1; Heb 8:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-11","title":"Jeremiah 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I will bring. 17; 6:19; 19:3,15; 23:12; 35:17; 36:31; 2Ki 22:16; 2Ch 34:24; Eze 7:5 which. 15:2; Pr 29:1; Isa 24:17; Am 2:14,15; 5:19; 9:1-4; 1Th 5:3; Heb 1:3 Re 6:16,17 escape. Heb. go forth of. cry. 14:12; Ps 18:41; 66:18; Pr 1:28; Isa 1:15; Eze 8:18; Mic 3:4 Zec 7:13; Lu 13:24-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-12","title":"Jeremiah 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>go. 2:28; 44:17-27; De 32:37; Jud 10:14; 2Ch 28:22; Isa 45:20 trouble. Heb. evil.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-13","title":"Jeremiah 11:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>For according. 2:28; 3:1,2; De 32:16,17; 2Ki 23:4,5,13; Isa 2:8; Ho 12:11 up altars. 19:5; 32:35; 2Ki 21:4,5 shameful thing. Heb. shame.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-14","title":"Jeremiah 11:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>pray. 7:16; 14:11; 15:1; Ex 32:10; Pr 26:24,25; 1Jo 5:16 for. 11; Ps 66:18; Ho 5:6 trouble. Heb. evil. 11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-15","title":"Jeremiah 11:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>What, etc. Heb. What is to my beloved in my house? Lu 8:28; *Gr: my. 2:2; 3:14; 12:7; Ho 3:1; Mt 22:11; Ro 11:28 to do. 3:8; 7:8-11; 15:1; Ps 50:16; Pr 15:8; 21:27; 28:9; Isa 1:11-15; 50:1 seeing. 3:1,2; Eze 16:25-34; 23:2-21 the holy. Hag 2:12-14; Tit 1:15 thou doest evil. or, thy evil is. Pr 2:14; 10:23; 26:18; 1Co 13:6; Jas 4:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-16","title":"Jeremiah 11:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>A green. Ps 52:8; Ro 11:17-24 with. Ps 80:16; Isa 1:30,31; 27:11; Eze 15:4-7; 20:47,48; Mt 3:10 Joh 15:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-17","title":"Jeremiah 11:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>that. 2:21; 12:2; 24:6; 42:10; 45:4; 2Sa 7:10; Ps 44:2; 80:8,15; Isa 5:2 Isa 61:3; Eze 17:5 pronounced. 11; 16:10,11; 18:8; 19:15; 26:13,19; 35:17; 36:7; 40:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-18","title":"Jeremiah 11:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>the Lord. 19; 1Sa 23:11,12; 2Ki 6:9,10,14-20; Eze 8:6-18; Mt 21:3; Ro 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-19","title":"Jeremiah 11:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I was. Pr 7:22; Isa 53:7 and I. 18:18; 20:10; Ps 31:13; 35:15; 37:32,33; Isa 32:7; Mt 26:3,4 destroy.\"Let us kill the prophet, and burn his prophecies.\"</p>\n<p>tree with the fruit. Heb. stalk with his bread. let us cut. Ps 83:4; Isa 53:8; Da 9:26; Lu 20:10-15 from. Job 28:13; Ps 27:13; 52:5; 116:9; 142:5 that his. Ps 109:13; 112:6; Pr 10:7; Isa 38:11; Nu 1:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-20","title":"Jeremiah 11:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>judgest. 12:1; Ge 18:25; Ps 98:9; Ac 17:31 triest. 17:10; 20:12; 1Sa 16:7; 1Ch 28:9; 29:17; Ps 7:9; Re 2:23 let. 15:15; 17:18; 18:20-23; 2Ti 4:14; Re 6:9,10; 18:20 revealed. 1Sa 24:15; Job 5:8; Ps 10:14,15; 35:2; 43:1; 57:1; Php 4:6; 1Pe 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-21","title":"Jeremiah 11:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>that seek. 12:5,6; 20:10; Mic 7:6; Mt 10:21,34-36; Lu 4:24 Prophesy. Isa 30:10; Am 2:12; 7:13-16; Mic 2:6-11 thou. 20:1,2; 38:1-6; Mt 21:35; 22:6; 23:34-37; Lu 13:33,34; Ac 7:51,52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-22","title":"Jeremiah 11:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>punish. Heb. visit upon. young. 9:21; 18:21; 2Ch 36:17; La 2:21; 1Th 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-11-23","title":"Jeremiah 11:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>no. 19; 44:27; Isa 14:20-22 the year. 5:9,29; 8:12; 23:12; 46:21; 48:44; 50:27; Ho 9:7; Mic 7:4; Lu 19:44</p>"}]}